{"parse": {"title": "Dimensional Star", "pageid": 1923, "revid": 10735, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/65/Dimensionalstar.png/revision/latest?cb=20221223140932\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dimensionalstar\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/65/Dimensionalstar.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20221223140932\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"136\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Dimensionalstar.png\" data-image-key=\"Dimensionalstar.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Dimensionalstar.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Dimensional Star</b>, added in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://animeadventures.fandom.com/wiki/Update_Log#Update_8_-_JoJo&#39;s_Bizarre_Adventure_+_Christmas_Update_Part_1\">Update 8</a>, is a reward obtained from reaching Room 100 in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Infinity Castle (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSW5maW5pdHlfQ2FzdGxlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Infinity Castle</span> (3rd Season). This item will become <b>unobtainable</b> as of Update 10.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span style=\"color:#FFC208;\">+Required to obtain a special unit...</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#921296;\"><i>\"I'm no one.\"</i></span></li></ul>\n<ul><li><span style=\"color:#fc4242;\">This Star is sealed with a powerful magic and cannot be opened yet...</span> (Prior to Update 10)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span